  data: {
    LLM: "Candyman: Make eye contact and wink when the Cop isn't looking. Vary your timing. Buyers: Watch everyone carefully to spot who is winking. Cop: Observe facial expressions and eye movements to catch the wink.\n\nCandyman: Use misdirection by looking at multiple people. Time your winks when the Cop is focused elsewhere. Buyers: Notice who other Buyers are watching. Cop: Watch for subtle reactions from Buyers who received winks.\n\nCandyman: Establish patterns then break them. Use the Cop's known identity (after wrong accusation) to your advantage. Buyers: Coordinate observations without revealing information. Cop: Use process of elimination and behavioral tells.",
